#: functions/function_adafruit_neokey_01.py:129
msgid ""
"This function executes specific actions when a key is pressed. After adding "
"actions at the bottom of this module, enter one or more short action IDs for"
" each key, separated by commas. The action ID can be found next to each "
"action (for example, for \"[Action 0559689e] Controller: Activate\" the "
"action ID is 0559689e). When entering action IDs, separate multiple IDs with"
" commas (for example, \"asdf1234\" or \"asdf1234,qwer5678,zxcv0987\"). "
"Actions are executed in the order of the entered text string. Enter the "
"action IDs to execute when a key is pressed. If you enable the toggle "
"action, the actions listed in the toggled action IDs are executed on "
"alternate key presses. You can set the LED color before a key is pressed, "
"after it is pressed, and while the last action is executing. The color is an"
" RGB string with values in the range 0 to 255. For example, enter \"255, 0, "
"0\" for red and \"0, 0, 255\" for blue."
msgstr ""
"此功能在按下按键时执行特定动作。在该模块底部添加动作后,为每个按键输入一个或多个短动作 ID,用逗号分隔。动作 ID "
"可在每个动作旁找到(例如“[Action 0559689e] Controller: Activate”中,动作 ID 为 "
"0559689e)。输入多个动作 ID "
"时,请用逗号分隔(例如“asdf1234”或“asdf1234,qwer5678,zxcv0987”)。动作将按输入文本字符串中的顺序执行。请输入按键按下时要执行的动作"
" ID。若启用切换动作,则每次交替按下该键时会执行切换动作 ID 中列出的动作。你可以设置按键按下前、按下后,以及最后一个动作执行期间的 LED "
"颜色。颜色为 RGB 字符串,取值范围为 0 到 255。例如,红色输入“255, 0, 0”,蓝色输入“0, 0, 255”。"

