#: config/__init__.py:534
msgid ""
"A PID (Proportional-Integral-Derivative) Controller continuously "
"regulates a measured condition toward a target Setpoint by adjusting one "
"or two Outputs. Select a measurement to read, set the Setpoint and the "
"P/I/D gains, and choose the Output(s) to raise and/or lower the value. "
"The controller is commonly used to automate temperature, humidity, CO2, "
"or pH."
msgstr ""
"PID(比例-积分-微分)控制器通过调节一个或两个输出,持续将测量条件调整至目标设定值。选择要读取的测量值,设置目标值和 P/I/D "
"增益,然后指定用于提高和/或降低数值的输出。该控制器常用于自动化控制温度、湿度、CO2 或 pH。"

#: config/__init__.py:556
msgid ""
"Time Point Trigger Functions will execute Actions every day at the "
"specified Time."
msgstr "时间点触发函数将在每天指定的时间执行动作。"

#: config/__init__.py:561
msgid ""
"Time Span Trigger Functions will execute Actions every day within the set"
" Start and End times, every Period. The first execution will be the Start"
" Time."
msgstr "时间段触发函数将在每天设定的开始与结束时间之间,按周期执行动作。首次执行为开始时间。"

#: config/__init__.py:566
msgid ""
"Duration Trigger Functions will execute Actions every Period from when it"
" is activated. A start offset can be added to delay the first execution."
msgstr "持续时间触发函数将从激活时刻起,按周期执行动作。可添加起始偏移量以延迟首次执行。"

#: config/__init__.py:582
msgid ""
"A Sequence Trigger runs an ordered list of Actions one step at a time "
"when activated. Add Actions to the sequence and they execute from top to "
"bottom, with an optional delay between steps. Use it to automate multi-"
"step routines — for example, open a vent, wait, then turn on a fan."
msgstr "序列触发器在激活时按顺序逐步执行动作列表。将动作添加到序列后,它们会从上到下依次执行,步骤之间可设置可选的延迟。可用于自动化多步骤流程——例如先打开通风口,等待,再打开风扇。"

#: functions/AoT_VPD.py:52
msgid ""
"This function calculates the Vapor Pressure Deficit (VPD) based on leaf "
"temperature and humidity. If leaf temperature is not provided, an offset "
"is applied to the air temperature instead."
msgstr "此函数根据叶片温度和湿度计算蒸气压亏缺(VPD)。若未提供叶片温度,则改为对空气温度应用偏移量。"

#: functions/AoT_average_multi_L.py:40
msgid ""
"Reads the latest data from the selected measurements, computes the "
"arithmetic mean, and stores the result with the specified "
"measurement/unit. Register the input measurements to aggregate by adding "
"the \"AoT Average: Input Measurement\" action in the [Actions] list "
"below. Only the average is stored; the original source values are not "
"stored separately."
msgstr ""
"读取所选测量值的最新数据,计算算术平均值,并以指定的测量值/单位存储结果。要注册用于汇总的输入测量值,请在下方[动作]列表中添加“AoT "
"平均值:输入测量值”动作。仅存储平均值,不会单独存储原始来源数值。"

#: functions/AoT_average_multi_L.py:86
msgid ""
"Default maximum age (in seconds). If set separately in an individual "
"input action, that value takes precedence."
msgstr "默认最大有效时间(秒)。若在单个输入动作中单独设置,则以该设置值为准。"

#: functions/average_last_multiple.py:52
msgid ""
"This function retrieves the last measurement of each selected "
"measurement, averages them, and stores the result with the selected "
"measurement and unit."
msgstr "此功能获取每个所选测量项的最后一次测量值,对它们求平均后,将结果以所选测量项和单位存储。"

#: functions/average_past_single.py:32
msgid ""
"This function retrieves past measurements (within Max Age) of the "
"selected measurement, calculates the average, and stores the result with "
"that measurement and unit. Note: InfluxDB 1.8.10 has a bug where the "
"mean() function does not work correctly. Therefore, when using InfluxDB "
"v1.x, the median() function is used instead. This issue does not occur in"
" InfluxDB 2.x, where the mean() function can be used normally. To obtain "
"an accurate average, upgrade to InfluxDB 2.x."
msgstr ""
"此功能获取所选测量项在过去一段时间内(Max Age 内)的历史测量值,计算平均值后,将结果以该测量项和单位存储。注意:InfluxDB "
"1.8.10 存在 mean() 函数无法正确工作的缺陷。因此在使用 InfluxDB v1.x 时,将改用 median() 函数代替。此问题在"
" InfluxDB 2.x 中不会出现,mean() 函数可以正常使用。若要获得准确的平均值,请升级到 InfluxDB 2.x。"

#: functions/backup_rsync.py:56
msgid ""
"This function backs up the current system data to a remote system using "
"rsync. The remote system must be running an SSH server and have rsync "
"installed. This system must also have rsync installed and be able to "
"access the remote system without a password via an SSH key file."
msgstr ""
"此功能使用 rsync 将当前系统的数据备份到远程系统。远程系统必须运行 SSH 服务器并已安装 rsync。本系统也必须已安装 "
"rsync,并能够通过 SSH 密钥文件免密访问远程系统。"

#: functions/bang_bang.py:23
msgid ""
"A simple Bang-Bang control method that uses a single input value to "
"control one output. Select the input, enter the **output, Setpoint, and "
"Hysteresis**, then choose the Direction. \t•\tRaise mode (e.g., heating):"
" the output turns on when the input is at or below (setpoint - "
"hysteresis), and turns off when the input is at or above (setpoint + "
"hysteresis). \t•\tLower mode (e.g., cooling): the opposite of the above, "
"turning the output on to lower the input."
msgstr ""
"一种简单的开关(Bang-"
"Bang)控制方式,使用单个输入值控制一个输出。选择输入,输入**输出、设定值(Setpoint)和滞回值(Hysteresis)**,然后选择方向(Direction)。"
"\t•\tRaise 模式(例如加热):当输入值等于或低于(设定值 - 滞回值)时输出开启,当输入值等于或高于(设定值 + 滞回值)时输出关闭。"
"\t•\tLower 模式(例如降温):与上述相反,开启输出以降低输入值。"

#: functions/bang_bang_on_off.py:20
msgid ""
"A simple Bang-Bang control method that uses a single input value to "
"control one or two outputs. Select the input, configure the Raise and/or "
"Lower outputs, then enter the **Setpoint and Hysteresis (operating range)"
" and choose the Direction.     •\tRaise mode (e.g., heating): the output "
"turns on when the input is at or below (setpoint - hysteresis), and turns"
" off when the input is at or above (setpoint + hysteresis).     •\tLower "
"mode (e.g., cooling): the opposite of the above, turning the output on to"
" lower the input.     •\tBoth: adjusts Raise and Lower to keep the input "
"at the setpoint."
msgstr ""
"一种简单的开关(Bang-Bang)控制方式,使用单个输入值控制一个或两个输出。选择输入,配置 Raise 和/或 Lower "
"输出,然后输入**设定值(Setpoint)和滞回值(Hysteresis,即工作范围)并选择方向(Direction)。     •\t"
"Raise 模式(例如加热):当输入值等于或低于(设定值 - 滞回值)时输出开启,当输入值等于或高于(设定值 + 滞回值)时输出关闭。     •"
"\tLower 模式(例如降温):与上述相反,开启输出以降低输入值。     •\tBoth:同时调节 Raise 和 "
"Lower,使输入值维持在设定值。"

#: functions/bang_bang_pwm.py:19
msgid ""
"A simple Bang-Bang control method that uses a single input value to "
"control one PWM output. Select the input, enter the PWM output, Setpoint,"
" and **Hysteresis**, then choose the Direction. \t•\tRaise mode (e.g., "
"heating): the output turns on when the input is at or below (setpoint - "
"hysteresis), and turns off when the input is at or above (setpoint + "
"hysteresis). \t•\tLower mode (e.g., cooling): the opposite of the above, "
"turning the output on to lower the input. \t•\tBoth mode: adjusts Raise "
"and Lower to keep the input at the setpoint. Note: this output only works"
" with a PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) output."
msgstr ""
"一种简单的开关(Bang-Bang)控制方式,使用单个输入值控制一个 PWM 输出。选择输入,输入 PWM "
"输出、设定值(Setpoint)和**滞回值(Hysteresis)**,然后选择方向(Direction)。\t•\tRaise "
"模式(例如加热):当输入值等于或低于(设定值 - 滞回值)时输出开启,当输入值等于或高于(设定值 + 滞回值)时输出关闭。\t•\tLower "
"模式(例如降温):与上述相反,开启输出以降低输入值。\t•\tBoth 模式:同时调节 Raise 和 "
"Lower,使输入值维持在设定值。注意:此输出仅适用于 PWM(脉宽调制)输出。"

#: functions/camera_libcamera.py:89
msgid ""
"Note: This function is currently experimental and should be used at your "
"own risk until this notice is removed. Captures images and video from the"
" camera using libcamera-still and libcamera-vid. This function must be "
"enabled to take still images, capture time-lapses, and use the Camera "
"Widget."
msgstr ""
"注意:此功能目前处于实验阶段,在本提示被移除之前,请自行承担使用风险。使用 libcamera-still 和 libcamera-vid "
"从摄像头捕获图像和视频。必须启用此功能才能拍摄静态图像、延时摄影,以及使用摄像头小组件(Camera Widget)。"

#: functions/difference.py:49
msgid ""
"This function retrieves two measurements, calculates their difference, "
"and stores the result with the selected measurement and unit."
msgstr "此功能获取两个测量值,计算它们的差值,并将结果以所选测量项和单位存储。"

#: functions/display_generic_lcd_16x2_i2c.py:160
msgid ""
"This function provides output to a 16x2 LCD display over I2C. This "
"display can show 2 lines at a time, so each change to the Number of Line "
"Sets adds 2 channels. The LCD refreshes every configured Period, "
"displaying the next set of lines. So the first 2 displayed lines are "
"channels 0 and 1, then 2 and 3, then 4 and 5, and so on. After all "
"channels have been displayed, it cycles back to the beginning."
msgstr ""
"此功能通过 I2C 向 16x2 LCD 显示屏提供输出。该显示屏每次可显示 2 行,因此“行组数量(Number of Line "
"Sets)”每增加一次会新增 2 个通道。LCD 会按设定的周期(Period)刷新,显示下一组行。因此最先显示的 2 行是通道 0 和 "
"1,接着是 2 和 3,然后是 4 和 5,依此类推。所有通道显示完毕后,会循环回到最初。"

#: functions/display_generic_lcd_20x4_i2c.py:160
msgid ""
"This function provides output to a 20x4 LCD display over I2C. This "
"display can show 4 lines at a time, so each change to the Number of Line "
"Sets adds 4 channels. The LCD refreshes every configured Period, "
"displaying the next set of lines. So the first 4 displayed lines are "
"channels 0, 1, 2, 3, then 4, 5, 6, 7, then 8, 9, 10, 11, and so on. After"
" all channels have been displayed, it cycles back to the beginning."
msgstr ""
"此功能通过 I2C 向 20x4 LCD 显示屏提供输出。该显示屏每次可显示 4 行,因此“行组数量(Number of Line "
"Sets)”每增加一次会新增 4 个通道。LCD 会按设定的周期(Period)刷新,显示下一组行。因此最先显示的 4 行是通道 "
"0、1、2、3,接着是 4、5、6、7,然后是 8、9、10、11,依此类推。所有通道显示完毕后,会循环回到最初。"

#: functions/display_grove_lcd_16x2_i2c.py:173
msgid ""
"This function provides output to a Grove 16x2 LCD display over I2C. This "
"display can show 2 lines at a time, so each change to the Number of Line "
"Sets adds 2 channels. The LCD refreshes every configured Period, "
"displaying the next set of lines. So the first 2 displayed lines are "
"channels 0 and 1, then channels 2 and 3, then channels 4 and 5, and so "
"on. After all channels have been displayed, it cycles back to the "
"beginning."
msgstr ""
"此功能通过 I2C 向 Grove 16x2 LCD 显示屏提供输出。该显示屏每次可显示 2 行,因此“行组数量(Number of Line "
"Sets)”每增加一次会新增 2 个通道。LCD 会按设定的周期(Period)刷新,显示下一组行。因此最先显示的 2 行是通道 0 和 "
"1,接着是通道 2 和 3,然后是通道 4 和 5,依此类推。所有通道显示完毕后,会循环回到最初。"

#: functions/display_ssd1306_oled_128x32_i2c.py:171
msgid ""
"This function provides output to a 128x32 SSD1306 OLED display over I2C. "
"This display function can show 4 lines at a time, so each change to the "
"Number of Line Sets adds 4 channels. The LCD refreshes every configured "
"Period, displaying the next set of lines. So the first displayed line set"
" is channels 0 - 3, then 4 - 7, then 8 - 11, and so on. After all "
"channels have been displayed, it cycles back to the beginning."
msgstr ""
"此功能通过 I2C 向 128x32 SSD1306 OLED 显示屏提供输出。该显示功能每次可显示 4 行,因此“行组数量(Number of "
"Line Sets)”每增加一次会新增 4 个通道。LCD 会按设定的周期(Period)刷新,显示下一组行。因此最先显示的行组是通道 0 - "
"3,接着是 4 - 7,然后是 8 - 11,依此类推。所有通道显示完毕后,会循环回到最初。"

#: functions/display_ssd1306_oled_128x32_i2c_2lines.py:172
msgid ""
"This function provides output to a 128x32 SSD1306 OLED display over I2C. "
"This display function can show 2 lines at a time, so each change to the "
"Number of Line Sets adds 2 channels. The LCD refreshes every configured "
"Period, displaying the next set of lines. So the first displayed line set"
" is channels 0 - 1, then 2 - 3, then 4 - 5, and so on. After all channels"
" have been displayed, it cycles back to the beginning."
msgstr ""
"此功能通过 I2C 向 128x32 SSD1306 OLED 显示屏提供输出。该显示功能每次可显示 2 行,因此“行组数量(Number of "
"Line Sets)”每增加一次会新增 2 个通道。LCD 会按设定的周期(Period)刷新,显示下一组行。因此最先显示的行组是通道 0 - "
"1,接着是 2 - 3,然后是 4 - 5,依此类推。所有通道显示完毕后,会循环回到最初。"

#: functions/example_function_all_options.py:41
msgid ""
"This function module is an example demonstrating the various UI option "
"types. It is intended only for learning how to develop new custom "
"function modules and has no other practical use. This message is "
"displayed above the function options. This function retrieves the last "
"selected measurement, turns the selected output on for 15 seconds, and "
"then deactivates it. Analyze the code to develop your own function module"
" and configure it so it can be imported from the Function Import page."
msgstr ""
"此功能模块是一个演示各种 UI "
"选项类型的示例。它仅用于学习如何开发新的自定义功能模块,没有其他实际用途。此消息显示在功能选项上方。此功能获取最后一次选择的测量值,将所选输出打开"
" 15 秒后关闭。请分析此代码来开发你自己的功能模块,并进行配置,使其可以从“功能导入(Function Import)”页面导入。"

#: functions/ext_context_collector.py:74
msgid ""
"Collects external temperature, humidity, wind speed, rainfall, solar "
"radiation, dew point, and CO2 from outside the facility. The integrated "
"environment control Function uses this collector as its single source of "
"truth. Select the external sensor for each item. Leave items blank to "
"apply the fallback default value."
msgstr ""
"采集设施外部的温度、湿度、风速、降雨量、太阳辐射、露点和 CO₂。集成环境控制 Function "
"使用此采集器作为唯一可信来源。请为每个项目选择对应的外部传感器。未设置的项目留空即可应用回退默认值。"

#: functions/ext_context_collector.py:92
msgid ""
"Collection period (seconds). Set it equal to or shorter than the "
"integrated control Function's cycle."
msgstr "采集周期(秒)。请设置为等于或短于集成控制 Function 的周期。"

#: functions/ext_context_collector.py:165
msgid "Measurements older than this are replaced with the fallback default value."
msgstr "超过此时长的测量值将被回退默认值替代。"

#: functions/function_adafruit_neokey_01.py:129
msgid ""
"This function executes specific actions when a key is pressed. After "
"adding actions at the bottom of this module, enter one or more short "
"action IDs for each key, separated by commas. The action ID can be found "
"next to each action (for example, for \"[Action 0559689e] Controller: "
"Activate\" the action ID is 0559689e). When entering action IDs, separate"
" multiple IDs with commas (for example, \"asdf1234\" or "
"\"asdf1234,qwer5678,zxcv0987\"). Actions are executed in the order of the"
" entered text string. Enter the action IDs to execute when a key is "
"pressed. If you enable the toggle action, the actions listed in the "
"toggled action IDs are executed on alternate key presses. You can set the"
" LED color before a key is pressed, after it is pressed, and while the "
"last action is executing. The color is an RGB string with values in the "
"range 0 to 255. For example, enter \"255, 0, 0\" for red and \"0, 0, "
"255\" for blue."
msgstr ""
"此功能在按下按键时执行特定动作。在该模块底部添加动作后,为每个按键输入一个或多个短动作 ID,用逗号分隔。动作 ID "
"可在每个动作旁找到(例如“[Action 0559689e] Controller: Activate”中,动作 ID 为 "
"0559689e)。输入多个动作 ID "
"时,请用逗号分隔(例如“asdf1234”或“asdf1234,qwer5678,zxcv0987”)。动作将按输入文本字符串中的顺序执行。请输入按键按下时要执行的动作"
" ID。若启用切换动作,则每次交替按下该键时会执行切换动作 ID 中列出的动作。你可以设置按键按下前、按下后,以及最后一个动作执行期间的 LED "
"颜色。颜色为 RGB 字符串,取值范围为 0 到 255。例如,红色输入“255, 0, 0”,蓝色输入“0, 0, 255”。"

#: functions/humidity_wet_dry_bulb.py:65
msgid ""
"This function calculates humidity based on wet-bulb and dry-bulb "
"temperature measurements."
msgstr "此功能根据湿球和干球温度测量值计算湿度。"

#: functions/lorawan_class_scheduler.py:95
msgid ""
"Light drives photosynthesis. Pick the radiation measurement (leave empty "
"to skip)."
msgstr "光照驱动光合作用。请选择辐射测量值(留空则跳过)。"

#: functions/lorawan_class_scheduler.py:156
msgid ""
"Server/token from Settings -> ChirpStack; devices assigned there "
"(\"Managed by\")."
msgstr "服务器/令牌来自 设置 -> ChirpStack;设备也在该处分配(\"管理方\")。"

#: functions/lorawan_class_scheduler.py:206
msgid ""
"Reads battery_V from ChirpStack metrics (requires INA219 wired). Low: "
"forces REST unless manual override is active. Critical: forces REST "
"unconditionally; valve-open interlock still applies."
msgstr ""
"从 ChirpStack 指标中读取 battery_V(需连接 "
"INA219)。偏低:除非手动覆盖处于激活状态,否则强制进入休息。危险:无条件强制进入休息;阀门开启互锁仍然有效。"

#: functions/lorawan_class_scheduler.py:213
msgid ""
"Heartbeat period (minutes) applied when battery is low or critical. "
"Should be >= REST HB to maximise sleep time."
msgstr "电池电量偏低或危险时应用的心跳周期(分钟)。应大于等于休息 HB,以最大化休眠时间。"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:45
msgid ""
"Determines the Class/heartbeat period based on battery, time of day, "
"valve activity, and link quality. Queues downlinks directly via "
"ChirpStack gRPC (DeviceService.Enqueue)."
msgstr ""
"根据电池状态、时段、阀门活动和链路质量确定 Class/心跳周期。通过 ChirpStack "
"gRPC(DeviceService.Enqueue)直接排队下行链路消息。"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:139
msgid ""
"Interval at which to re-apply the same mode when there is no ACK (0 "
"disables retry)"
msgstr "无 ACK 时重新应用相同模式的间隔（0 表示禁用重试）"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:153
msgid ""
"Only in Auto mode is the Class switched according to the mode; selecting "
"a specific class keeps that class."
msgstr "仅在自动模式下才会根据当前模式切换 Class；选择特定类别时将保持该类别不变。"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:169
msgid ""
"Sets the hours during which performance mode operates. Enter 0–24, or if "
"the start and end times are equal it means 24 hours."
msgstr "设置性能模式运行的时段。输入 0–24，若起止时间相同则表示全天 24 小时。"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:193
msgid ""
"Specifies, in minutes, how far in advance of the daytime start to switch "
"to performance (Class C) mode."
msgstr "指定在白天开始前提前多少分钟切换到性能（Class C）模式。"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:272
msgid "Sets the mode-switching thresholds."
msgstr "设置模式切换阈值。"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:280
msgid ""
"Automatically switches the mode according to the battery voltage. (Active"
" only when the LoRa class policy is Auto.)"
msgstr "根据电池电压自动切换模式。（仅在 LoRa 类别策略为自动时生效）"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:288
msgid "Voltage threshold at which stable operation is possible"
msgstr "可稳定运行的电压基准"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:296
msgid "Voltage threshold for switching to power-saving mode"
msgstr "切换到节能模式的电压基准"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:304
msgid "Voltage threshold for switching to ultra-saving mode"
msgstr "切换到超级节能模式的电压基准"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:312
msgid ""
"Holds off on mode/period changes when the battery measurement is missing "
"or too old."
msgstr "当电池测量值缺失或过旧时，暂停模式/周期变更。"

#: functions/lorawan_mode_manager.py:337
msgid ""
"If battery current exceeds this value, the valve is considered active and"
" the device stays in performance mode. 0 disables this check."
msgstr "如果电池电流超过此值,则视为阀门处于工作状态,设备将保持在性能模式。设为 0 可禁用此检查。"

#: functions/pid_autotune.py:43
msgid ""
"This function attempts to automatically tune a PID controller. That is, "
"it enables the output and measures the response from the sensor multiple "
"times to calculate the P, I, and D gain values. Updates on the operating "
"status are written to the daemon log, and when autotuning completes "
"successfully a summary is also stored in the daemon log. Only raising the"
" current measurement is supported; lowering the measurement may require "
"some modification of the controller code. To monitor whether the output "
"is normally raising the measurement above the setpoint, it is recommended"
" to graph the measurement and output on the dashboard. The autotune "
"feature is experimental and not fully developed. It is likely it will not"
" generate proper PID gains, so it is recommended not to rely on this "
"function for accurate PID controller tuning."
msgstr ""
"此功能尝试自动整定 PID 控制器。具体来说,它会启用输出,并多次测量传感器的响应以计算 P、I、D "
"增益值。运行状态的更新会写入守护进程日志,自动整定成功完成后,摘要信息也会存储在守护进程日志中。目前仅支持提高测量值的场景;若要降低测量值,可能需要对控制器代码进行一些修改。为了监控输出是否正常地将测量值提升到设定值以上,建议在仪表盘上将测量值和输出绘制成图表。自动整定功能目前处于实验阶段,尚未完全开发完成。它很可能无法生成合适的"
" PID 增益值,因此不建议依赖此功能来进行精确的 PID 控制器整定。"

#: functions/redundancy.py:49
msgid ""
"This function stores the first available measurement. It is useful when "
"you want to configure multiple sensors for backup. If you order the "
"sensors by priority, this function checks the first measurement for "
"existence, and if absent, checks the next measurement, repeating the "
"process. When a measurement is found, it is stored in the database with "
"the custom measurement and unit. The output of this function can be used "
"as an input throughout AoT. If you need to check three or more "
"measurements, you can chain multiple redundancy functions by setting the "
"output of the first function as the input of the second."
msgstr ""
"此功能存储第一个可用的测量值。当您希望配置多个传感器作为备份时,这非常有用。如果按优先级对传感器进行排序,此功能会先检查第一个测量值是否存在,若不存在,则检查下一个测量值,依此类推。找到测量值后,会以自定义的测量值和单位存储到数据库中。此功能的输出可在"
" AoT 全局范围内作为输入使用。如果需要检查三个或更多测量值,可以通过将第一个功能的输出设为第二个功能的输入,以此串联多个冗余功能。"

#: functions/regulate_ph_ec.py:45
msgid ""
"This function uses two pumps (acid and base solutions) to regulate pH, "
"and can use up to four pumps (A, B, C, D nutrient solutions) to regulate "
"electrical conductivity (EC). You only need to configure the nutrient "
"solution outputs you intend to use. Outputs that are not configured are "
"not activated during EC adjustment, and you can use from one to four "
"pumps. Outputs can operate in units of duration (seconds) or volume (ml),"
" and each output type must be matched to the selected output channel (an "
"on/off output channel for duration control, a volume output channel for "
"volume control). The mixing ratio of the nutrient solutions is determined"
" by the duration or volume setting of each EC output. If you enter an "
"email address (or multiple addresses separated by commas) in the email "
"notification field, a notification email is sent in the following cases. "
"<br>1) when the pH value goes outside the configured danger range, 2) "
"when the EC value is too high and water must be added to the storage "
"tank, 3) when no measurement can be found in the database within a given "
"Max Age range. <br>Each email notification type has its own timer so that"
" the same notification is not sent repeatedly, and the same notification "
"is not sent for the duration of the configured email timer. <br>Once this"
" duration elapses, the timer resets automatically, allowing a new "
"notification to be sent. You can also manually reset the email timers "
"using the Custom Commands below. <br>When the function is enabled, status"
" text is displayed at the bottom of the screen showing the regulation "
"information and the total duration/volume of each output."
msgstr ""
"此功能使用两个水泵(酸液和碱液)来调节 pH,并可使用最多四个水泵(A、B、C、D "
"营养液)来调节电导率(EC)。您只需配置打算使用的营养液输出。未配置的输出在 EC "
"调节过程中不会被激活,您可以使用一到四个水泵。输出可以按持续时间(秒)或体积(ml)为单位运行,每种输出类型都必须与所选输出通道相匹配(持续时间控制对应开/关输出通道,体积控制对应体积输出通道)。营养液的混合比例由每个"
" EC "
"输出的持续时间或体积设置决定。如果您在电子邮件通知字段中输入一个电子邮件地址(或用逗号分隔的多个地址),则在以下情况下会发送通知邮件。<br>1)"
" 当 pH 值超出设定的危险范围时,2) 当 EC 值过高、需要向储液罐中加水时,3) "
"当在给定的最大有效期范围内数据库中找不到测量值时。<br>每种电子邮件通知类型都有自己的计时器,以防止同一通知被重复发送,在配置的邮件计时器持续时间内不会再次发送相同的通知。<br>一旦此持续时间结束,计时器会自动重置,从而允许发送新的通知。您也可以使用下方的自定义命令手动重置邮件计时器。<br>启用该功能后,屏幕底部会显示状态文本,展示调节信息以及每个输出的总持续时间/体积。"

#: functions/statistics_last_multiple.py:85
msgid ""
"This function retrieves multiple measurements, calculates statistics, and"
" stores the results with the selected unit."
msgstr "此功能获取多个测量值,计算统计数据,并以所选单位存储结果。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:64
msgid ""
"Sums a single measurement source over time. Interval mode sums every "
"value between cycles (per-cycle usage). Point mode samples one value at a"
" recurring time-of-day (every N hours, in the device timezone) and sums "
"the most recent N snapshots. The result is stored with the selected "
"measurement and unit."
msgstr ""
"对单个测量值来源随时间进行求和。间隔模式对各周期之间的所有数值求和(每周期用量)。定点模式按重复的时刻(设备时区下每 N "
"小时一次)对单个数值进行采样,并对最近 N 个快照求和。结果以所选测量值和单位存储。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:87
msgid ""
"Interval: sum all values in the [previous run, now] window. Point: sum "
"the most recent N snapshot values."
msgstr "间隔:对 [上次运行, 当前] 区间内的所有数值求和。定点:对最近 N 个快照数值求和。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:127
msgid ""
"[Point mode] Time-of-day anchor for snapshots in the device timezone "
"(e.g. 00:00). Use 24:00 for midnight."
msgstr "[定点模式] 设备时区下快照的基准时刻(例如 00:00)。午夜请使用 24:00。"

#: functions/sum_accumulate.py:138
msgid ""
"[Point mode] Hours between snapshots, starting from the anchor (e.g. 24 ="
" once daily, 6 = four times daily)"
msgstr "[定点模式] 自基准时刻起的快照间隔小时数(例如 24 = 每天一次,6 = 每天四次)"

#: functions/sum_last_multiple.py:53
msgid ""
"This function retrieves the last value of each selected measurement, sums"
" them, and stores the result with the selected measurement and unit."
msgstr "此功能获取每个所选测量值的最新值,将其求和,并以所选测量值和单位存储结果。"

#: functions/sum_past_single.py:53
msgid ""
"This function retrieves past measurements (within Max Age) of the "
"selected measurement, sums them, and stores the result with the selected "
"measurement and unit."
msgstr "此功能获取所选测量值的过去测量值(在最大有效期内),将其求和,并以所选测量值和单位存储结果。"

#: functions/verification.py:49
msgid ""
"This function acquires two measurements, calculates their difference, and"
" stores Measurement A if the difference is not greater than the "
"configured threshold. This lets you verify one sensor's measurement "
"against another sensor's measurement. Since the measurement is only "
"stored when the two sensors agree, you can use the stored measurement in "
"Conditional Functions and similar to notify the user when no measurement "
"is present, indicating a possible sensor problem."
msgstr ""
"此功能获取两个测量值,计算它们的差值,如果差值不大于设定的阈值,则存储测量值 "
"A。这样可以将一个传感器的测量值与另一个传感器的测量值进行比对校验。由于只有当两个传感器的数值一致时才会存储测量值,因此您可以在条件功能(Conditional"
" Functions)等场景中使用该存储的测量值,在没有测量值时通知用户,提示传感器可能存在问题。"

#: inputs/ads1015_circuitpython.py:82 inputs/ads1115_circuitpython.py:83
#: inputs/ads1x15.py:83 inputs/ina219x.py:156
msgid ""
"The number of times to measure each channel. An average of the "
"measurements will be stored."
msgstr ""
"The number of times to measure each channel. An average of the "
"measurements will be stored."

#: inputs/chirpstack_MQTT_jmespath.py:53
msgid ""
"Subscribes to the ChirpStack v4 MQTT broker topic "
"(application/+/device/+/event/up) to receive events, and applies per-"
"channel JMESPath expressions to each event JSON to store measurements. "
"Examples (https://jmespath.org): object.battery_V, object.battery_pct, "
"max_by(rxInfo,&rssi).rssi, max_by(rxInfo,&snr).snr, deviceInfo.devEui."
msgstr ""
"订阅 ChirpStack v4 MQTT 代理的主题(application/+/device/+/event/up)以接收事件,并对每个事件 "
"JSON 应用按通道设置的 JMESPath "
"表达式来存储测量值。示例(https://jmespath.org):object.battery_V、object.battery_pct、max_by(rxInfo,&rssi).rssi、max_by(rxInfo,&snr).snr、deviceInfo.devEui。"

#: inputs/chirpstack_MQTT_jmespath.py:147
msgid "Comma-separated subscription topics (e.g. application/+/device/+/event/up)"
msgstr "以逗号分隔的订阅主题（例如 application/+/device/+/event/up）"

#: inputs/chirpstack_MQTT_jmespath.py:163
msgid "Optional: process only specific devices. Enter EUIs separated by commas"
msgstr "可选：仅处理指定设备。请输入以逗号分隔的 EUI"

#: inputs/chirpstack_jmespath.py:123
msgid ""
"Periodically calls the ChirpStack v4 REST API to fetch device events, and"
" applies per-channel JMESPath expressions to each event JSON to store "
"measurements. Examples (https://jmespath.org): object.battery_V, "
"object.battery_pct, max_by(rxInfo,&rssi).rssi, max_by(rxInfo,&snr).snr, "
"deviceInfo.devEui."
msgstr ""
"定期调用 ChirpStack v4 REST API 获取设备事件,并对每个事件 JSON 应用按通道设置的 JMESPath "
"表达式来存储测量值。示例(https://jmespath.org):object.battery_V、object.battery_pct、max_by(rxInfo,&rssi).rssi、max_by(rxInfo,&snr).snr、deviceInfo.devEui。"

#: inputs/chirpstack_jmespath.py:150
msgid ""
"Base address of the ChirpStack REST API (e.g. http://localhost:8080) (the"
" REST proxy is typically on port 8090)"
msgstr "ChirpStack REST API 的基础地址（例如 http://localhost:8080）（REST 代理通常使用 8090 端口）"

#: inputs/chirpstack_jmespath.py:158
msgid ""
"Bearer token for accessing the ChirpStack REST API (issued from the admin"
" console)"
msgstr "访问 ChirpStack REST API 所需的 Bearer 令牌（从管理控制台颁发）"

#: inputs/chirpstack_jmespath.py:174
msgid "Optional: use to query only devices belonging to a specific application"
msgstr "可选：用于仅查询属于指定应用的设备"

#: inputs/chirpstack_jmespath.py:182
msgid ""
"Optional: enter the device EUIs to query, separated by commas. If empty, "
"all devices in the application are targeted"
msgstr "可选：输入要查询的设备 EUI，以逗号分隔。留空则以应用中的所有设备为目标"

#: inputs/chirpstack_jmespath.py:206
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"URL template used for REST requests when the official Python client is "
"unavailable (appended after the API Base URL). {dev_eui}, {limit}, "
"{kind}, {after} are substituted automatically"
msgstr ""
"官方 Python 客户端不可用时，用于 REST 请求的 URL 模板（附加在 API 基础 URL "
"之后）。{dev_eui}、{limit}、{kind}、{after} 将被自动替换"

#: inputs/chirpstack_rak3172_valve_hb.py:70
msgid ""
"Directly decodes the RAK3172 valve controller's heartbeat (FPort 225) "
"payload from the ChirpStack v4 MQTT broker and stores battery voltage, "
"node class, HB period, valve states, and RSSI/SNR. This input is used as "
"the measurement source for lorawan_mode_manager's input_node_class / "
"input_node_hb / input_vbat / input_rssi / input_snr."
msgstr ""
"直接从 ChirpStack v4 MQTT 代理解码 RAK3172 阀门控制器的心跳（FPort 225）负载，并存储电池电压、节点类别、HB"
" 周期、阀门状态以及 RSSI/SNR。该输入用作 lorawan_mode_manager 的 input_node_class / "
"input_node_hb / input_vbat / input_rssi / input_snr 的测量值来源。"

#: inputs/chirpstack_rak3172_valve_hb.py:148
msgid ""
"Enter an ID to subscribe to a specific app only. Leave empty to use \"+\""
" (all)."
msgstr "输入 ID 以仅订阅特定应用。留空则使用 \"+\"（全部）。"

#: inputs/chirpstack_rak3172_valve_hb.py:156
msgid ""
"Process only specific devices. Leave empty to receive all (multiple can "
"be specified, comma-separated)."
msgstr "仅处理指定设备。留空则接收全部（可用逗号分隔指定多个）。"

#: inputs/chirpstack_rak3172_valve_hb.py:172
msgid ""
"Decode the 0xA6 ext frame (HB period, actual class, valve states, etc.) "
"on FPort 225."
msgstr "解码 FPort 225 上的 0xA6 ext 帧(HB 周期、实际类别、阀门状态等)。"

#: inputs/ecowitt_mqtt.py:89
msgid ""
"Subscribes to channels automatically generated based on the selected "
"Ecowitt device type, extracts values from the URL-encoded or JSON payload"
" sent over the MQTT topic using each channel's JMESPATH expression, and "
"stores them in the database. Per-channel measurement units and conversion"
" settings can be specified via custom options."
msgstr ""
"订阅根据所选 Ecowitt 设备类型自动生成的通道,使用各通道的 JMESPATH 表达式从通过 MQTT 主题发送的 URL 编码或 JSON"
" 载荷中提取数值,并存储到数据库中。可通过自定义选项指定各通道的测量单位和转换设置。"

#: inputs/ecowitt_soil_moisture.py:25 inputs/ecowitt_temp_and_humidity.py:25
#: inputs/ecowitt_weather.py:44
msgid ""
"To use the Ecowitt Cloud API, enter the Application Key, API Key, and "
"device MAC address."
msgstr "要使用 Ecowitt Cloud API,请输入 Application Key、API Key 和设备 MAC 地址。"

#: inputs/kma_weather_500.py:129
msgid ""
"After issuing a free API key from the KMA API Hub, data is requested "
"based on the location (latitude/longitude) in the input settings. Note: "
"the Korea Meteorological Administration API allows 20000 calls per day, "
"and each call returns data for a single observation station."
msgstr ""
"从气象厅 API Hub 获取免费 API 密钥后,系统会根据输入设置中的位置(纬度/经度)请求数据。注意:韩国气象厅 API 每天最多允许调用 "
"20000 次,每次调用返回一个观测站的数据。"

#: inputs/kma_weather_500.py:161
msgid ""
"Ignore or correct obvious outliers (e.g. humidity 0%, pressure 0hPa, "
"etc.)."
msgstr "忽略或修正明显的异常值(例如湿度 0%、气压 0hPa 等)。"

#: inputs/kma_weather_500.py:187
msgid ""
"When enabled after saving, performs a single backfill immediately and "
"then turns off automatically."
msgstr "保存后启用时,会立即执行一次回填,随后自动关闭。"

#: inputs/kma_weather_500.py:194
msgid "Separate Precipitation Series"
msgstr "分离降水序列"

#: inputs/kma_weather_500.py:195
msgid ""
"Record the precipitation indicator (rn_ox) and 15-min precipitation "
"(rn_15m) under different measurement names to avoid conflicts."
msgstr "将降水指示值(rn_ox)和 15 分钟降水量(rn_15m)记录为不同的测量名称,以避免冲突。"

#: inputs/kma_weather_500.py:204
msgid ""
"Accept 0°C only when the previous valid value is within this range of "
"0°C. Default ±3°C."
msgstr "仅当前一个有效值在此范围内接近 0°C 时才接受 0°C。默认 ±3°C。"

#: inputs/kma_weather_forecast.py:154
msgid ""
"This module provides short-term agricultural forecast data. Based on the "
"most recent announcement, it collects forecast data for the time offset "
"selected by the user. The API call uses a service key from the Public "
"Data Portal, and extracts temperature, min/max temperature, wind speed, "
"wind direction, sky condition, humidity, precipitation, precipitation "
"probability, precipitation type, and fresh snowfall from the JSON "
"response. (Data is available from 10 minutes after the announcement "
"time.)"
msgstr ""
"该模块提供农业用短期预报数据。以最近一次发布为基准,采集用户所选时间偏移后的预报数据。API 调用使用公共数据门户提供的服务密钥,并从 JSON "
"响应中提取气温、最低/最高气温、风速、风向、天空状况、湿度、降水量、降水概率、降水形态和新增积雪等数据。(数据自发布时间 10 分钟后开始提供。)"

#: inputs/kma_weather_forecast.py:215
msgid "Set how many times to retry the same announcement time on an HTTP error."
msgstr "设置发生 HTTP 错误时对同一发布时间重试的次数。"

#: inputs/kma_weather_stn_L.py:65
msgid ""
"Issue a free API key from the KMA API Hub and enter the STN of the "
"nearest observation station. Note: the free API allows 20000 calls per "
"day, and each call returns data for a single observation station."
msgstr ""
"请从气象厅 API Hub 获取免费 API 密钥,并输入最近观测站的 STN。注意:免费 API 每天最多允许调用 20000 "
"次,每次调用返回一个观测站的数据。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_bing.py:17
msgid ""
"Microsoft global map service providing high-resolution aerial imagery "
"(Aerial) and aerial with labels (Hybrid), with clean and precise road "
"maps."
msgstr "Microsoft 全球地图服务,提供高分辨率航拍影像(Aerial)和带标注的航拍影像(Hybrid),以及清晰精确的道路地图。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_carto.py:16
msgid ""
"Data analysis-focused maps from CARTO DB. Offers restrained color schemes"
" with Positron (light), Dark Matter (dark), and Voyager styles, designed "
"to make data points and sensor information stand out."
msgstr ""
"来自 CARTO DB 的数据分析专用地图。提供 Positron(浅色)、Dark Matter(深色)和 Voyager "
"等克制的配色方案,专为突出数据点和传感器信息而设计。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_esri.py:8
msgid ""
"Authoritative map service from global GIS leader Esri. Provides crisp and"
" detailed World Imagery aerial satellite photos, optimized for accurate "
"terrain and facility visualization."
msgstr ""
"来自全球 GIS 领导厂商 Esri 的权威地图服务。提供清晰、详细的 World Imagery "
"航拍卫星图像,针对精确的地形与设施可视化进行了优化。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_google.py:32
msgid ""
"Most widely used Google web map service. Supports Road, Satellite, "
"Hybrid, and Terrain modes based on vast geographic information. Terrain "
"mode excels at showing contours and hillshading. Also supports Geocoding "
"API for address-to-coordinate conversion. API key available from Google "
"Developer Console."
msgstr ""
"使用最广泛的 Google "
"网络地图服务。基于海量地理信息,支持道路、卫星、混合和地形模式,其中地形模式在显示等高线和山体阴影方面表现出色。同时支持地址转坐标的 "
"Geocoding API。API 密钥可在 Google 开发者控制台获取。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_gsi.py:16
msgid ""
"High-precision public map service from Japan Geospatial Information "
"Authority (GSI). Contains detailed terrain and place name information "
"across Japan, with professional layers including standard maps, pale "
"maps, and aerial photography."
msgstr "来自日本国土地理院(GSI)的高精度公共地图服务。包含日本全境详细的地形与地名信息,提供标准地图、淡色地图、航拍照片等专业图层。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_image_overlay.py:30
msgid ""
"Overlay a user-uploaded aerial or drone photo on the map. On upload, GPS "
"and camera pose embedded in the photo (EXIF/XMP) are used to place it "
"automatically; the four corners can then be dragged to fine-tune the fit "
"against map features."
msgstr ""
"在地图上叠加用户上传的航拍或无人机照片。上传时会根据照片中嵌入的 GPS "
"和相机姿态信息(EXIF/XMP)自动放置,之后可拖动四个角点,使其与地图地物精细对齐。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_isric.py:19
msgid ""
"Global soil characteristic map from World Soil Information Service "
"(ISRIC). Visualizes soil composition (clay, sand, etc.), pH levels, and "
"carbon content for geological analysis as overlayer data."
msgstr "来自世界土壤信息服务(ISRIC)的全球土壤特性地图。将土壤成分(黏土、沙土等)、pH 值和碳含量以叠加图层数据的形式可视化,可用于地质分析。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_mapbox.py:22
msgid ""
"Stylish Mapbox vector and tile maps with excellent customization. "
"Supports Streets, Satellite, Dark, and Light styles with superior "
"rendering performance for smooth map interaction."
msgstr "自定义程度极高的时尚 Mapbox 矢量瓦片地图。支持 Streets、Satellite、Dark、Light 等样式,渲染性能出色,操作流畅。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_maptiler_vector.py:24
msgid ""
"High-performance vector tile map service. Supports multiple styles "
"(streets, light, dark, satellite, etc.) with excellent rendering "
"performance and HD display."
msgstr "高性能矢量瓦片地图服务。支持多种样式(街道、浅色、深色、卫星等),渲染性能出色,支持高清显示。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_nasa_gibs.py:71
msgid ""
"Real-time Earth observation maps from NASA GIBS satellite system. "
"Includes satellite imagery (Blue Marble) plus environmental data like "
"temperature, clouds, and fires, selectable by date for time-series "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"来自 NASA GIBS 卫星系统的实时地球观测地图。包含卫星影像(Blue "
"Marble)以及温度、云层、火灾等环境数据,可按日期选择,支持时间序列分析。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_opentopomap.py:8
msgid ""
"Terrain map service based on OpenStreetMap data with emphasized contours "
"and hillshading. Clear differentiation for mountain terrain and slope "
"analysis, high readability, suitable for hiking and outdoor activity "
"visualization."
msgstr "基于 OpenStreetMap 数据的地形地图服务,突出显示等高线和山体阴影。山地地形与坡度分析区分清晰,可读性高,适合徒步和户外活动可视化。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_openweather.py:18
msgid ""
"Weather-focused service displaying global weather information as map "
"overlays. Provides real-time clouds, precipitation, temperature, wind "
"speed, pressure, and radar data for intuitive weather situational "
"awareness."
msgstr "以地图叠加形式显示全球气象信息的气象专用服务。提供实时云层、降水、气温、风速、气压和雷达数据,便于直观掌握天气状况。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_osm.py:10
msgid ""
"Free map data created collaboratively by users worldwide in Wikipedia-"
"style. Available at no cost with road and building information "
"continuously updated by an active community. Standard web map with global"
" coverage."
msgstr "由全球用户以维基百科方式协作创建的免费地图数据。活跃社区持续更新道路和建筑信息,可免费使用。是覆盖全球的标准网络地图。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_stadia.py:21
msgid ""
"High-quality design-focused map server from Stadia Maps. Provides clean "
"layouts with eye-comfortable colors and high-quality fonts using Alidade "
"Smooth, Dark, OSMBright styles, ideal for professional dashboard "
"creation."
msgstr ""
"Stadia Maps 提供的高品质设计专用地图服务。采用 Alidade Smooth、Dark、OSMBright "
"等样式,配色柔和护眼、字体精美、布局简洁,适合制作专业仪表盘。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_thunderforest.py:23
msgid ""
"Unique themed maps tailored for specific purposes using OpenStreetMap "
"data. Experience visually striking styles including cycling routes "
"(Cycle), public transport (Transport), night maps, and rugged landscapes."
msgstr ""
"基于 OpenStreetMap "
"数据、针对特定用途定制的独特主题地图。可体验骑行路线(Cycle)、公共交通(Transport)、夜间地图、地形强调等视觉效果出众的样式。"

#: inputs_gis/gis_vworld.py:46
msgid ""
"Vworld spatial information open platform from Korea Ministry of Land, "
"Infrastructure and Transport. Provides the most precise national high-"
"resolution aerial photography, digital maps, cadastral maps, and real-"
"time traffic data. The most specialized national standard map for "
"domestic business support."
msgstr ""
"韩国国土交通部 Vworld "
"空间信息开放平台。提供最精确的国家级高分辨率航拍影像、数字地图、地籍图和实时交通数据。是最适合韩国本地业务支持的国家标准地图。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:41
msgid ""
"Time-based opening control (0–100%) for vents, curtains, and ball valves."
" Connects an Open relay and a Close relay to a single percentage command."
msgstr "通风窗、幕布和球阀的基于时间的开度控制(0–100%)。将一个开启继电器和一个关闭继电器连接到单一百分比命令上。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:82
msgid ""
"Seconds to travel from fully closed (0%) to fully open (100%). If unset, "
"the close travel time is used as a fallback. Use the Calibration buttons "
"below to measure automatically."
msgstr "从完全关闭(0%)到完全开启(100%)所需的移动时间(秒)。若未设置,将以关闭行程时间作为备用值。可使用下方的校准按钮自动测量。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:93
msgid ""
"Seconds to travel from fully open (100%) to fully closed (0%). If unset, "
"the open travel time is used as a fallback."
msgstr "从完全开启(100%)到完全关闭(0%)所需的移动时间(秒)。若未设置,将以开启行程时间作为备用值。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:103
msgid ""
"Reference only (informational). Motor position (%) at which the mechanism"
" visually begins to open. The command value is used as the motor position"
" directly and is NOT rescaled by this field — a command of 22% maps "
"directly to motor position 22."
msgstr ""
"仅供参考(信息性)。机构在视觉上开始开启时的电机位置(%)。命令值将直接作为电机位置使用,不会根据此字段重新换算 — 22% "
"的命令将直接映射为电机位置 22。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:115
msgid ""
"Reference only (informational). Motor position (%) regarded as fully "
"open. The command value is used as the motor position directly and is NOT"
" capped by this field. A command of 0% always moves to the physical end-"
"stop (emergency fully-closed)."
msgstr ""
"仅供参考(信息性)。视为完全开启状态的电机位置(%)。命令值将直接作为电机位置使用,不会被此字段限制上限。0% "
"的命令始终会移动到物理限位(紧急完全关闭)。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:127
msgid ""
"Motor lifespan protection for automatic environment control. The motor "
"moves only when the target differs from the last sent position by at "
"least this much, and commands snap to this grid (e.g. 5% → 0, 5, 10 …). "
"This absorbs the small per-cycle fluctuations of the PI controller so the"
" motor is not driven every cycle. Set to 0 to disable — every minor "
"fluctuation then drives the motor (legacy behavior)."
msgstr ""
"用于自动环境控制的电机寿命保护。仅当目标值与上次发送的位置相差至少此数值时,电机才会移动,且命令会按此网格取整(例如 5% → "
"0、5、10……)。这可以吸收 PI 控制器每个周期的小幅波动,避免电机每个周期都被驱动。设为 0 可禁用此功能 — "
"此时任何微小波动都会驱动电机(旧版行为)。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:161
msgid ""
"Reject any new Open/Close command that arrives within this many seconds "
"of the previous one. Prevents queued-up motor whiplash from rapid button "
"presses. Stop is always accepted regardless of this interval."
msgstr "拒绝在上一条命令之后此秒数内到达的任何新的打开/关闭命令。可防止因快速按键而导致电机命令堆积和急剧反转。停止命令不受此间隔限制,始终会被接受。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:172
msgid ""
"Dwell time inserted when reversing direction (open↔close) to protect the "
"motor. Both relays stay OFF for this many seconds before the new "
"direction starts."
msgstr "在反转方向(打开↔关闭)时插入的停顿时间,用于保护电机。在新方向开始之前,两个继电器都将保持关闭状态此秒数。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:182
msgid ""
"Swap Open and Close relays in software. Enable when 0% physically deploys"
" the actuator and 100% pulls it back (e.g. thermal curtain wired with "
"Close = deploy)."
msgstr "在软件中互换打开继电器和关闭继电器。若 0% 时执行器实际展开、100% 时收回(例如保温幕布的接线为“关闭 = 展开”),请启用此选项。"

#: outputs/actuator_paired.py:211
msgid ""
"Stops the actuator and saves elapsed time to Travel Time Open or Travel "
"Time Close."
msgstr "停止执行器,并将经过的时间保存到“打开移动时间”或“关闭移动时间”。"

#: outputs/on_off_ecowitt.py:44
msgid ""
"Enter the Ecowitt hub IP, sub-device ID, and model (WFC01/02=1, WFC02 new"
