msgstr "删除此记录？如果确实种植过，请改用\"结束\"——删除会将其从历史记录中移除。"

msgid "Deletion is rejected if any facility references it."
msgstr "如果有任何设施引用它，删除将被拒绝。"

msgid "Derivative Gain"
msgstr "微分增益"

msgid "Direct week adjustment on top of elapsed weeks. Positive = fast-forward, negative = compensate downtime."
msgstr "在已过周数基础上直接调整周数。正值 = 快进，负值 = 补偿停机时间。"

